{"title":"Stitch & B*tch - Tuesdays, 5-9PM (Bi-Weekly)","startsAt":"2026-10-20T17:00:00-04:00","endsAt":"2026-10-20T21:00:00-04:00","status":"ACTIVE","type":"PHYSICAL","description":"We know you have a stash of unfinished WIPs and UFOs, but can't find the motivation to finish them.\n\nCome out and stitch with us! We'll be hosting a bi-weekly social stitch night to allow for folks to body double while knitting, crocheting, drawing, and more! It's a great opportunity to meet new people, exchange tips and tricks, all while working through your backlog of projects.\n\nDon't have a fiber project? Bring a canvas, ipad, some blank sneakers, or any other project.\n\nSeating fee of $5+tax/person.\nIf you do not RSVP for the event OR pre-purchase your event ticket on our site by noon on the day of the event the price will be $8+ tax.\n\nHope to see you there!","venue":{"name":"LVLUP GAMES","address":"833 Westlock Rd Unit #9, Mississauga","lat":43.566883,"lng":-79.64203,"city":"Mississauga"},"fee":{"amount":5,"currency":"CAD"},"group":"Mississauga Board Gamers United","image":"https://secure.meetupstatic.com/photos/event/7/2/8/1/highres_530489313.jpeg"}